Atluna,

Thanks for your response. I was in fact on too low a memory machine. I'm now on a 500G machine and have successfully read the files into a single object. Thanks!

These data are from an RRBS experiment. I'm requiring a minimum read of 10 reads at a single site. And, I've required that sites be covered in 25 controls/25 cases)
meth=unite(filtered.myobj, destrand=TRUE, min.per.group=25L)

